          "_name": "slider04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"slider4 mbr-embla\" group=\"Gallery &amp; Slider\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"embla\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\" checked=\"\">\n        <input inline=\"\" type=\"range\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input inline=\"\" type=\"range\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked=\"\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\" checked=\"\">\n        <header>Carousel</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"autoplay\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Interval\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" step=\"1\" condition=\"autoplay\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Loop\" name=\"loop\" checked=\"\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Draggable\" name=\"draggable\" checked=\"\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrows\" title=\"Arrows\" checked=\"\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"gap\" title=\"Gap\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\" checked=\"\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"carouselHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"autoSize\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax=\"\">\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/soba1-1.jpg\" parallax=\"\" selected=\"\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffd769\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked=\"\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                    <b>First floor</b></h3>\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Snuggle up in the plush double bed in your cozy upstairs bedroom. A handy vanity table sits beside the bed, perfect for getting ready for a night out or just relaxing at home. To keep you comfy, there's air conditioning and a personal safe for your valuables. And for entertainment, you've got a Samsung SmartTV to binge-watch your favorite shows or movies.\n<div>After a good night's sleep, freshen up in your private en suite bathroom. There's a refreshing shower to wash away the day and a toilet for convenience.\n</div><div><br></div></h5>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"embla position-relative\" data-loop=\"{{loop}}\" data-auto-play=\"{{autoplay}}\" data-auto-play-interval=\"{{interval}}\" data-draggable=\"{{draggable}}\" data-skip-snaps=\"true\" data-align=\"center\" data-contain-scroll=\"trimSnaps\">\n                    <div class=\"embla__viewport\">\n                        <div class=\"embla__container\">\n                            <div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item active\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/254-20220526-121214-3333x1875.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/254-20220526-121359-3333x1875.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/254-20220526-121430-1406x2500.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/254-20220526-121350-3333x1875.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/254-20220526-121325-1406x2500.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"5\" data-bs-slide-to=\"5\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/254-20220526-121319-1406x2500.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"6\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/254-20220526-121442-1406x2500.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"8\" data-bs-slide-to=\"8\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/254-20220526-121124-3333x1875.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title=\"\" data-slide-to=\"9\" data-bs-slide-to=\"9\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--prev\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--next\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
